 need. If the offer is unclear, quote the confusing sentence and propose a precise alternative instead of writing ‘improve the copy’."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","section","Minutes 2–4: follow the mobile journey",{"id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-heading font-semibold text-ink","children":"Minutes 2–4: follow the mobile journey"}],[["$","p","On a phone, open the menu, find a service and reach contact. Check whether text fits the screen and sticky elements cover buttons. Then use a desktop keyboard to move through the main controls.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"On a phone, open the menu, find a service and reach contact. Check whether text fits the screen and sticky elements cover buttons. Then use a desktop keyboard to move through the main controls."}],["$","p","A screenshot is useful evidence of a layout problem. Include the viewport width and steps to reproduce it. ‘Does not work on mobile’ alone does not give someone enough information to fix it.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"A screenshot is useful evidence of a layout problem. Include the viewport width and steps to reproduce it. ‘Does not work on mobile’ alone does not give someone enough information to fix it."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Do links deliver what their labels promise?",{"children":"Do links deliver what their labels promise?"}],["$","li","Can you see focus without using a mouse?",{"children":"Can you see focus without using a mouse?"}],["$","li","Can you close the menu and return to the content?",{"children":"Can you close the menu and return to the content?"}]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Minutes 4–6: check speed, not a perfect score",{"id":"section-3","children":["$L17",["$L18","$L19"],"$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c"],"$L1d","$L1e"]}]
