18:["$","p","Run PageSpeed Insights for the selected URL. Distinguish field data from real users and a laboratory test. Missing field data does not mean the site is fast or slow: it means the report lacks a sufficient sample.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"Run PageSpeed Insights for the selected URL. Distinguish field data from real users and a laboratory test. Missing field data does not mean the site is fast or slow: it means the report lacks a sufficient sample."}]
19:["$","p","Core Web Vitals track main-content loading (LCP), interaction responsiveness (INP) and layout stability (CLS). One lab score does not represent every visitor’s experience. Record an obvious issue, such as an oversized hero image, and retest after changing it.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"Core Web Vitals track main-content loading (LCP), interaction responsiveness (INP) and layout stability (CLS). One lab score does not represent every visitor’s experience. Record an obvious issue, such as an oversized hero image, and retest after changing it."}]
1a:["$","section","Minutes 6–8: test contact end to end",{"id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-heading font-semibold text-ink","children":"Minutes 6–8: test contact end to end"}],[["$","p","A visible button is not the same as working contact. Check phone numbers, field labels and error messages. Send a test message only with the owner’s agreement, then confirm it actually arrived.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"A visible button is not the same as working contact. Check phone numbers, field labels and error messages. Send a test message only with the owner’s agreement, then confirm it actually arrived."}],["$","p","Do not enter sensitive information for a test. If the form provides no clear confirmation or the owner never receives the message, fixing that takes priority over polishing button shadows.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"Do not enter sensitive information for a test. If the form provides no clear confirmation or the owner never receives the message, fixing that takes priority over polishing button shadows."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1b:["$","section","Minutes 8–10: turn findings into an order of work",{"id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-heading font-semibold text-ink","children":"Minutes 8–10: turn findings into an order of work"}],[["$","p","Keep the three most important findings. For each, record: URL → problem → evidence → proposed change → verification. Fix task blockers first, understanding second and visual details last.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"Keep the three most important findings. For each, record: URL → problem → evidence → proposed change → verification. Fix task blockers first, understanding second and visual details last."}],["$","p","Example note: ‘Contact page at 375 px: the menu covers the button. Reduce its height or allow scrolling. Verify by opening the menu and reaching contact without overlap.’ That is an actionable, testable task.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"Example note: ‘Contact page at 375 px: the menu covers the button. Reduce its height or allow scrolling. Verify by opening the menu and reaching contact without overlap.’ That is an actionable, testable task."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Now: broken contact or inaccessible content.",{"children":"Now: broken contact or inaccessible content."}],["$","li","Next: unclear offers, navigation and readability.",{"children":"Next: unclear offers, navigation and readability."}],["$","li","Later: cosmetic improvements that do not block the task.",{"children":"Later: cosmetic improvements that do not block the task."}]]}],"$undefined"]}]
1c:["$","section","What this quick review cannot confirm",{"id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-heading font-semibold text-ink","children":"What this quick review cannot confirm"}],[["$","p","Indexing, canonicals, redirects, security and full accessibility need separate investigation. Use Search Console with the owner’s access to inspect indexing; simply viewing a page cannot confirm its Google index status.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"Indexing, canonicals, redirects, security and full accessibility need separate investigation. Use Search Console with the owner’s access to inspect indexing; simply viewing a page cannot confirm its Google index status."}],["$","p","The same caution applies to AI search results. Google says AI Overviews and AI Mode have no special additional technical requirements. Useful text, crawlability and accurate information remain the foundation; no audit guarantees a citation or ranking.",{"className":"text-muted","children":"The same caution applies to AI search results. Google says AI Overviews and AI Mode have no special additional technical requirements. Useful text, crawlability and accurate information remain the foundation; no audit guarantees a citation or ranking."}]],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
